                "value": "=✅ *URL AMAN*\n\n🔗 URL: `{{ $('Rangkum Phishing').item.json.url }}`\n🖥️ Agent: {{ $('Rangkum Phishing').item.json.agent_name }}\n🕐 Waktu: {{ $('Rangkum Phishing').item.json.timestamp }}\n\n🔎 Google Safe Browsing: {{ $('Rangkum Phishing').item.json.gsb_text }}\n🔎 URLScan: {{ $('Rangkum Phishing').item.json.us_text }}\nℹ️ URL tidak terdeteksi berbahaya.",
